# StatusCoherence — Hecksagon
#
# Infrastructure declaration for the StatusCoherence aggregate.
# This is a derived view / coherence checker — it owns no source
# truth, only a snapshot fed in by the runner. Memory adapter is
# correct: the snapshot is per-render-cycle state, not persistent
# history. The shell runner (status_coherence.sh) is the temporary
# substrate until the runtime hosts RecordSnapshot dispatch and
# predicate-returning queries natively (i101).
#
# When i101 lands and GAP-1 / GAP-2 / GAP-3 are closed, the runner
# becomes a simple:
#   storehouse dispatch StatusCoherence::StatusCoherence.RecordSnapshot …
# followed by querying ViolationOne through ViolationSix.
#
Hecks.hecksagon "StatusCoherence" do
  adapter :memory
end
